OL,3,GNEWSAPublic toilets to charge after
OL,4,Adrug and alcohol use
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charge will be introduced to use
OL,7,Fpublic toilets in the centre of a
OL,8,Fseaside town after reports of drug and
OL,9,Falcohol use and anti-social behaviour.
OL,11,FThe loos on Maiden Street in Weymouth
OL,12,Fwill be closed for five months while
OL,13,Frefurbishment works are carried out.
OL,15,FThe town council said it was part of a
OL,16,F"commitment to improving its toilet
OL,17,Ffacilities across the town over the
OL,18,Fnext few years".
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
