OL,3,GNEWSAPublic toilets to charge after
OL,4,Adrug and alcohol use
OL,5,
OL,6,FDave Taylor, who petitioned for all
OL,7,Fpublic toilets in the town to be free
OL,8,Fto use, said: "The issue with these
OL,9,Ftoilets is they are primarily used by
OL,10,Fstreet drinkers, drug takers etc due to
OL,11,Fthe location and there's no other
OL,12,Fpassing trade."
